1
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:12,530
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:15,700
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:18,530
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:21,710
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:26,050
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:29,270
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:32,070
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,310 --> 00:00:35,940
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,290 --> 00:00:39,410
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:42,760
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:45,680
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:49,010
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:56,940 --> 00:00:58,860
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,140 --> 00:01:00,380
=Episode 27=

15
00:01:00,380 --> 00:01:03,280
(Nanyuan Kingdom)

16
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,070
Lord of Nanyuan Kingdom,

17
00:01:10,480 --> 00:01:11,430
You've been defeated.

18
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:13,200
Draft the decree now

19
00:01:13,480 --> 00:01:14,430
and proclaim it to the world:

20
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:17,150
From now on, Tianxuan Kingdom will be
the only kingdom in the Southern Domain.

21
00:01:17,150 --> 00:01:19,310
(Jiang Chao, Holy Lord of Nanyuan)

22
00:01:19,310 --> 00:01:20,040
I won't draft.

23
00:01:20,870 --> 00:01:21,510
I refuse

24
00:01:22,430 --> 00:01:23,790
to live as a slave of a fallen nation!

25
00:01:24,120 --> 00:01:25,870
Then you'll have to die!

26
00:01:27,590 --> 00:01:28,870
Who dares touch him?

27
00:01:33,230 --> 00:01:33,870
Sect Master Wang,

28
00:01:34,430 --> 00:01:35,280
what do you mean by this?

29
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:37,350
Sects must not interfere
in conflicts between kingdoms.

30
00:01:37,590 --> 00:01:39,480
It's an unwritten rule
that's stood for centuries.

31
00:01:39,950 --> 00:01:40,790
I'm sorry, Holy Maiden.

32
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:42,510
I'm no longer the sect master.

33
00:01:43,150 --> 00:01:44,430
This is the new sect master's decision.

34
00:01:44,590 --> 00:01:45,510
The new sect master?

35
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:49,200
I am.

36
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:52,400
Zhao Feiyang?

37
00:01:53,430 --> 00:01:54,230
You're still alive?

38
00:01:54,710 --> 00:01:55,230
I am.

39
00:01:56,150 --> 00:01:57,790
And I united the Three Great Sects.

40
00:01:58,430 --> 00:01:58,870
You...

41
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:00,920
How did you manage that?

42
00:02:01,230 --> 00:02:01,950
Strength.

43
00:02:02,430 --> 00:02:04,040
What level have you actually reached?

44
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:05,950
Half-step Earth Immortal.

45
00:02:10,960 --> 00:02:12,190
Does your promise still stand?

46
00:02:14,310 --> 00:02:15,240
Nanyuan Kingdom

47
00:02:15,470 --> 00:02:17,310
is willing to offer
all it's cultivation resources.

48
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:19,280
From now on,

49
00:02:19,680 --> 00:02:21,280
we will cease all cultivation!

50
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:23,630
Very well.

51
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:28,280
Now, Tianxuan Kingdom must decide.

52
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:29,590
What do you want?

53
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:30,960
On Shenwu Continent,

54
00:02:31,870 --> 00:02:34,870
cultivators have always stood
above ordinary people

55
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:37,150
and are beyond the laws
of the mortal world.

56
00:02:37,590 --> 00:02:38,710
To protect themselves,

57
00:02:38,960 --> 00:02:40,430
the kingdoms also seek cultivation.

58
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:42,400
This only throws the world's order

59
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:43,360
into greater chaos.

60
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:45,310
In the end,
it's ordinary folks who suffer.

61
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:46,590
That's why I united the sects

62
00:02:46,870 --> 00:02:48,190
to put all cultivators

63
00:02:48,430 --> 00:02:49,800
under the full authority of the sects,

64
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:53,310
while the common folk remain
under the kingdoms.

65
00:02:53,470 --> 00:02:54,710
Neither side interferes with the other.

66
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:56,710
So I hope Tianxuan Kingdom

67
00:02:56,910 --> 00:02:58,120
will do as Nanyuan Kingdom has

68
00:02:58,750 --> 00:03:00,680
and follow the rules I've laid down.

69
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:02,030
If you refuse,

70
00:03:02,470 --> 00:03:03,190
you'll be destroyed.

71
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:11,710
I knew I wasn't wrong about you.

72
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:14,430
Actually, you and I want the same thing.

73
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:16,360
I simply lacked the power
to make it happen.

74
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:17,630
You do.

75
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:19,000
That works just as well.

76
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:21,800
Cultivators frighten ordinary people.

77
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:23,470
The Southern Domain's Three Great Sects

78
00:03:23,710 --> 00:03:24,840
and tens of thousands of
rogue cultivators

79
00:03:25,150 --> 00:03:26,310
all pose unpredictable risks

80
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:27,960
to ordinary people.

81
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:30,080
Now, by keeping the two apart,

82
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:32,190
you're surely a blessing to the people.

83
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:33,560
Rest assured.

84
00:03:33,910 --> 00:03:35,680
All of Tianxuan Kingdom's resources

85
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:37,120
will be handed over in full.

86
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:40,680
We will no longer pursue cultivation.

87
00:03:41,520 --> 00:03:42,030
What about yourself?

88
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:43,960
I won't join your sect.

89
00:03:44,630 --> 00:03:45,840
But I will leave the Southern Domain.

90
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:46,960
Where will you go?

91
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:48,120
The Eastern Domain?

92
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:49,680
The Western Domain?

93
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:51,310
Or the Northern Domain?

94
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:52,960
I'll go to Central State,

95
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:56,030
a world belonging solely to cultivators.

96
00:03:57,430 --> 00:03:59,280
A world belonging solely to cultivators?

97
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:02,030
Take care.

98
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:07,280
Take care.

99
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:10,360
(Solitude Sect)
Sect Master,

100
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:11,400
I have good news.

101
00:04:11,870 --> 00:04:13,430
All of Nanyuan Kingdom's
cultivation resources

102
00:04:13,590 --> 00:04:15,190
have been consolidated.

103
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:15,840
Sect Master,

104
00:04:16,310 --> 00:04:18,070
all cultivators in the Southern Domain
at the Body Tempering Realm or above

105
00:04:18,270 --> 00:04:19,920
have been brought into the sect.

106
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:22,430
Those rogue cultivators
who refused to join

107
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:23,800
have all been expelled
from the Southern Domain.

108
00:04:24,190 --> 00:04:26,720
Tianxuan Kingdom has also handed over
all its resources.

109
00:04:26,950 --> 00:04:29,190
And its cultivation forces
have joined the sect

110
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:30,430
or been driven out.

111
00:04:30,870 --> 00:04:31,830
In other words,

112
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:36,190
all the cultivation resources
and cultivators in the Southern Domain

113
00:04:37,070 --> 00:04:39,070
are now gathered within the sect.

114
00:04:39,870 --> 00:04:42,680
Congratulations, Sect Master!
You've completed your great undertaking!

115
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:44,070
No.

116
00:04:54,430 --> 00:04:55,750
There's one final step.

117
00:05:14,390 --> 00:05:16,120
Sect Master, what are you doing?

118
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:17,190
I'm only one man.

119
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:19,600
I can't possibly control
every word and action

120
00:05:19,750 --> 00:05:22,360
of every cultivator
in the Southern Domain.

121
00:05:23,070 --> 00:05:23,630
So,

122
00:05:24,430 --> 00:05:27,160
I will create a region
with no cultivators.

123
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:29,270
You three elders,

124
00:05:30,510 --> 00:05:32,240
and every cultivator
in the Southern Domain,

125
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:33,600
I'll take

126
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:35,680
all your spiritual energy!

127
00:05:39,190 --> 00:05:40,360
Sect Master, please stop!

128
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:04,830
So it really is Zhao Feiyang!

129
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:06,480
Seems we've got no other option.

130
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:07,480
Let's go.

131
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:21,600
My dear,

132
00:06:23,430 --> 00:06:24,920
I always knew this was possible,

133
00:06:26,270 --> 00:06:27,120
but I never imagined

134
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:28,950
it would really be you...

135
00:06:31,390 --> 00:06:32,120
Should I...

136
00:06:34,190 --> 00:06:35,240
help you or not?

137
00:06:39,390 --> 00:06:40,070
(Sword Immortal Inn; Clear Breeze)
Young man.

138
00:06:40,560 --> 00:06:42,040
What's meant to come

139
00:06:42,160 --> 00:06:44,160
will come.

140
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:45,430
You...

141
00:06:46,830 --> 00:06:48,430
You're on your own. Good luck.

142
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:51,800
No!

143
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:54,120
We don't want to be mortals!

144
00:06:54,310 --> 00:06:54,870
Stop!

145
00:06:55,120 --> 00:06:55,870
Stop it now!

146
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:57,920
You're defying the Heavenly Dao!

147
00:07:08,390 --> 00:07:09,120
My spiritual power...

148
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:10,270
My cultivation...

149
00:07:11,070 --> 00:07:11,750
Why are they being drained?

150
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:12,360
What...

151
00:07:12,480 --> 00:07:13,270
what is happening?

152
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:16,500
(Heavenly Sword Sect)

153
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:20,360
Solitude Sect

154
00:07:21,070 --> 00:07:22,310
is hereby disbanded.

155
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:25,390
No more sects in the Southern Domain.

156
00:07:30,630 --> 00:07:31,630
You are free to leave.

157
00:08:02,830 --> 00:08:03,750
(It worked?)

158
00:08:05,950 --> 00:08:06,480
Yes.

159
00:08:07,870 --> 00:08:09,750
(Time to complete your mission.)

160
00:08:14,870 --> 00:08:16,040
The great tribulation is coming.

161
00:08:16,430 --> 00:08:18,750
Your fate will decide everything.

162
00:08:20,740 --> 00:08:21,340
(Heavenly Sword Sect)

163
00:08:30,510 --> 00:08:31,720
Judging by your aura,

164
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:34,670
you've joined Nether Hall?

165
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:36,360
I'm the heir to Nether Hall.

166
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:37,670
The heir?

167
00:08:38,150 --> 00:08:39,870
They lack the courage to face me,

168
00:08:40,030 --> 00:08:41,080
so they sent you?

169
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:42,320
Interesting.

170
00:08:42,510 --> 00:08:43,120
Zhao Feiyang,

171
00:08:43,480 --> 00:08:44,360
I'm from the Southern Domain.

172
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:46,630
You've robbed every cultivator
of their spiritual energy.

173
00:08:47,080 --> 00:08:48,000
Such actions

174
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:49,870
make you a scourge of Shenwu Continent.

175
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:50,600
Today,

176
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:51,750
I'll put an end to you!

177
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:53,600
Just how high is your cultivation

178
00:08:54,320 --> 00:08:55,750
to be making such bold claims?

179
00:09:01,115 --> 00:09:01,870
(Solitude Sect)

180
00:09:04,030 --> 00:09:05,390
Void-Shattering Strike.

181
00:09:07,030 --> 00:09:08,080
Earthly Immortal Realm, huh?

182
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:08,840
You...

183
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:10,600
you're not even surprised?

184
00:09:12,510 --> 00:09:13,240
A little.

185
00:09:13,550 --> 00:09:14,030
You!

186
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:24,960
Are you here to kill me too?

187
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:25,630
Zhao Feiyang,

188
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:26,630
I'm sorry.

189
00:09:27,030 --> 00:09:27,750
We have no choice.

190
00:09:28,030 --> 00:09:28,840
The great tribulation is coming.

191
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:31,150
You're hastening the great tribulation.

192
00:09:31,390 --> 00:09:32,840
We can't let you run wild.

193
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:35,270
Because you're the trigger
for the great tribulation.

194
00:09:35,750 --> 00:09:37,480
(Heavenly Sword Sect)
Whether I'm the trigger

195
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:40,030
for the great tribulation
doesn't matter to me.

196
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:43,390
A fierce battle

197
00:09:43,910 --> 00:09:44,910
is inevitable today.

198
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:46,720
Then I'll take you all on.

199
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:37,440
Set up the formation!

200
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:38,600
Which formation?

201
00:10:40,360 --> 00:10:41,390
Heavenly Mystery Evil-Slaying Formation.

202
00:10:41,750 --> 00:10:42,360
Must we really do this?

203
00:10:42,510 --> 00:10:43,720
Originally, our master refused

204
00:10:43,750 --> 00:10:44,870
to become the trigger
for the great tribulation.

205
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:46,200
That's why he gave us this order.

206
00:10:46,790 --> 00:10:47,390
Now,

207
00:10:47,870 --> 00:10:49,550
a new trigger
for the great tribulation has emerged.

208
00:10:49,750 --> 00:10:50,910
We have no choice

209
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:51,840
but to stop him.

210
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:54,510
Form the formation!

211
00:11:37,910 --> 00:11:39,000
We only have one chance.

212
00:11:39,510 --> 00:11:40,670
Help us at once!

213
00:11:59,910 --> 00:12:01,200
So it really is aimed at me?

214
00:12:44,120 --> 00:12:45,200
I thought you wouldn't come.

215
00:12:45,600 --> 00:12:47,670
How could I stay away
when you're in trouble?

216
00:12:50,750 --> 00:12:52,150
Even if I'm the trigger

217
00:12:52,270 --> 00:12:53,030
for the great tribulation?

218
00:12:56,790 --> 00:12:59,320
Didn't you save me back then,
even though I'm a demon?

219
00:12:59,790 --> 00:13:00,910
But I didn't realize it then.

220
00:13:01,390 --> 00:13:03,910
Then maybe being the trigger
for the great tribulation isn't...

221
00:13:12,630 --> 00:13:13,270
Bai Xi,

222
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:14,720
do you know

223
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:16,480
what will happen to Shenwu Continent

224
00:13:16,790 --> 00:13:18,270
if you stop us from killing him?

225
00:13:18,670 --> 00:13:19,720
The great tribulation, isn't it?

226
00:13:20,150 --> 00:13:21,120
You're not afraid at all?

227
00:13:21,390 --> 00:13:22,000
Of course I am.

228
00:13:22,870 --> 00:13:24,120
The fear grows with age.

229
00:13:24,910 --> 00:13:25,790
But...

230
00:13:27,360 --> 00:13:29,270
The hatred between demons and humans

231
00:13:29,390 --> 00:13:30,480
is insignificant

232
00:13:30,670 --> 00:13:31,910
compared to the great tribulation.

233
00:13:32,270 --> 00:13:34,000
You should join forces with us,

234
00:13:34,150 --> 00:13:35,320
not stop us.

235
00:13:35,510 --> 00:13:37,480
Now, although he has absorbed
boundless spiritual power,

236
00:13:37,840 --> 00:13:39,120
he still hasn't reached
the Earthly Immortal Realm.

237
00:13:39,360 --> 00:13:40,600
If he becomes an immortal in one leap,

238
00:13:40,720 --> 00:13:42,120
no one can stop him.

239
00:13:42,480 --> 00:13:43,910
This is our only chance.

240
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:44,750
Of course,

241
00:13:44,910 --> 00:13:46,750
we know what you two have been through,

242
00:13:47,080 --> 00:13:48,270
and we understand your dilemma.

243
00:13:48,510 --> 00:13:50,390
You may not care about the world,

244
00:13:50,600 --> 00:13:52,150
but won't you think of

245
00:13:52,270 --> 00:13:52,870
your million fellow demons?

246
00:13:58,550 --> 00:13:59,440
I'm sorry, dear.

247
00:14:00,440 --> 00:14:02,600
I regret giving you that Dao Bone.

248
00:14:03,510 --> 00:14:05,080
If you were an ordinary man,

249
00:14:06,630 --> 00:14:08,120
I might have spent my life with you.

250
00:14:08,870 --> 00:14:09,720
But perhaps,

251
00:14:10,270 --> 00:14:12,030
it was all destined to happen.

252
00:14:20,270 --> 00:14:21,000
Say no more.

253
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:23,720
I understand.

254
00:14:27,440 --> 00:14:28,510
Given the situation now,

255
00:14:28,960 --> 00:14:29,870
have you accepted your fate?

256
00:14:33,550 --> 00:14:34,270
Never.

257
00:14:41,150 --> 00:14:41,840
Why?

258
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:43,480
Why can't my spiritual energy
and cultivation art

259
00:14:43,630 --> 00:14:44,550
resist you?

260
00:14:45,240 --> 00:14:45,870
Zhao Feiyang!

261
00:14:46,550 --> 00:14:48,320
I sensed it as soon as you arrived.

262
00:14:49,390 --> 00:14:51,240
The source of your spiritual energy
is linked to mine.

263
00:14:52,080 --> 00:14:54,320
Nether Hall must've invested heavily

264
00:14:54,750 --> 00:14:56,600
to train you to this level.

265
00:14:57,200 --> 00:14:59,240
It seems you were prepared just for me.

266
00:14:59,480 --> 00:15:00,270
Though I don't know

267
00:15:00,390 --> 00:15:01,750
what their purpose is.

268
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:03,390
I have no choice but to do this.

269
00:15:03,750 --> 00:15:04,720
Sorry, Cuihua.

270
00:15:05,440 --> 00:15:06,320
I'll take

271
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:08,270
your cultivation.

272
00:15:09,790 --> 00:15:10,270
Oh no!

273
00:15:43,150 --> 00:15:45,630
So this is the so-called
Earthly Immortal Realm?

274
00:15:47,630 --> 00:15:49,000
Not much to it.

275
00:15:53,900 --> 00:15:54,860
(Earthly Immortal Realm, Stage 1)

276
00:15:57,700 --> 00:16:02,100
(Earthly Immortal Realm, Stage 3)

277
00:16:03,980 --> 00:16:07,500
(Earthly Immortal Realm, Stage 6)

278
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:15,390
♪This mortal flesh, a heart forged hard♪
(Earthly Immortal Realm, Stage 9)

279
00:16:19,390 --> 00:16:20,030
We're done for.

280
00:16:21,150 --> 00:16:22,480
You all mean so much to me.

281
00:16:23,360 --> 00:16:24,150
Without you,

282
00:16:24,550 --> 00:16:25,670
I wouldn't be where I am today.

283
00:16:26,320 --> 00:16:28,120
As for whether I'm the trigger
for the great tribulation,

284
00:16:28,320 --> 00:16:28,910
it doesn't matter.

285
00:16:29,320 --> 00:16:30,000
Now,

286
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:32,630
I need to uncover some truths.

287
00:16:38,120 --> 00:16:39,270
Though we're in the same realm,

288
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:41,000
his cultivation is now above ours.

289
00:16:41,150 --> 00:16:41,960
We can't catch up to him.

290
00:16:42,240 --> 00:16:43,240
We'll have to find another way.

291
00:16:43,870 --> 00:16:44,750
Why?

292
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:48,440
Why is this happening again?

293
00:16:50,120 --> 00:16:52,320
I can only be your stepping stone.

294
00:16:53,030 --> 00:16:53,790
Zhao Feiyang...

295
00:16:55,390 --> 00:16:56,320
Why?

296
00:16:57,510 --> 00:16:58,510
Why?

297
00:17:03,240 --> 00:17:04,240
Got anything to say?

298
00:17:05,550 --> 00:17:06,310
I don't know.

299
00:17:06,880 --> 00:17:09,720
Our only choice now is to ask
Central State for help.

300
00:17:09,830 --> 00:17:11,510
Central State has been isolated
from the Four Domains for millennia.

301
00:17:11,680 --> 00:17:13,110
Will they intervene?

302
00:17:13,400 --> 00:17:15,270
Before the great tribulation,
all beings are equal.

303
00:17:15,790 --> 00:17:17,510
Even Central State,
known as the Immortal Realm,

304
00:17:17,830 --> 00:17:19,400
probably can't just stand by.

305
00:17:19,830 --> 00:17:21,160
Looks like there's no other way.

306
00:17:22,350 --> 00:17:23,720
What about you, Bai Xi?

307
00:17:24,310 --> 00:17:25,110
Any thoughts?

308
00:17:25,310 --> 00:17:26,640
I'm going to the Sea of Chaos

309
00:17:27,030 --> 00:17:28,030
to find the Demon Ancestor.

310
00:17:28,680 --> 00:17:30,160
Isn't he already dead?

311
00:17:31,110 --> 00:17:32,070
He was reborn through nirvana.

312
00:17:32,750 --> 00:17:33,440
Didn't you know?

313
00:17:34,350 --> 00:17:34,830
What?

314
00:17:35,680 --> 00:17:36,510
Are you scared?

315
00:17:37,270 --> 00:17:39,270
Didn't you say the demon-human conflict

316
00:17:39,750 --> 00:17:41,640
means nothing before
the great tribulation?

317
00:17:48,830 --> 00:17:49,480
Dear,

318
00:17:50,590 --> 00:17:51,750
I'm rather curious to see

319
00:17:52,960 --> 00:17:54,440
what you'll do next.

320
00:17:55,420 --> 00:18:00,140
(To Be Continued, Stay Tuned)

321
00:18:03,740 --> 00:18:07,530
♪I once stood on high,
drawing spiritual energy into my blade♪

322
00:18:07,780 --> 00:18:09,930
♪I laughed, pointing at the stars,
young and fearless♪

323
00:18:10,500 --> 00:18:14,050
♪Then came my fall,
with frost and snow on my shoulders♪

324
00:18:14,180 --> 00:18:18,610
♪My Dao foundation was damaged,
yet my Dao heart never wavered♪

325
00:18:18,780 --> 00:18:21,930
♪I crossed countless peaks
to find my answer again♪

326
00:18:22,770 --> 00:18:25,440
♪Through endless trials,
my Nascent Soul came♪

327
00:18:25,660 --> 00:18:29,060
♪Heaven and earth my furnace,
I rose from the flame♪

328
00:18:29,140 --> 00:18:32,870
♪No sword in hand,
yet numberless blades obey♪

329
00:18:33,740 --> 00:18:36,910
♪I seek the Dao beyond the clouds♪

330
00:18:37,180 --> 00:18:40,300
♪Unafraid of countless trials♪

331
00:18:41,100 --> 00:18:43,620
♪With this flesh and soul♪

332
00:18:43,940 --> 00:18:47,170
♪I shall forge a new age♪

333
00:18:47,380 --> 00:18:50,250
♪Let thunder and fire crown me♪

334
00:18:50,620 --> 00:18:53,710
♪Let wind and clouds heed me♪

335
00:18:53,930 --> 00:18:56,570
♪At cultivation's peak♪

336
00:18:56,580 --> 00:18:59,930
♪My first resolve remains unchanged♪

337
00:19:00,700 --> 00:19:03,410
♪The sun and moon turn♪

338
00:19:03,410 --> 00:19:06,930
♪I hear the Great Dao ring♪

339
00:19:07,320 --> 00:19:13,910
♪I am the undying flame♪

340
00:19:14,900 --> 00:19:19,570
♪Looking back when dust settles♪

341
00:19:19,830 --> 00:19:22,930
♪At last I see, immortality♪

342
00:19:23,380 --> 00:19:28,070
♪Lives in your smiles♪
